// Dynamic conflict check (R2) on Test Flight: ONE combined boot with every member, plus ONE differential boot per
// changed member that the static engine flagged together with another member (the combined set minus that member).
// No pairwise matrix (GAPS B10). Pure planning + pure evidence merge; the flights themselves run through
// lib/cyrus/testflight/client.ts (node-2, one at a time). HONESTY RULE: a flight that did not run (busy, error,
// missing) is "not_run"/"incomplete", never a pass; a finding the boot cannot observe is "not_observable", not
